    {
      "key": "tc7f63bb2b3508006",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What is slippage in forex?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">FXにおけるスリッページとは何ですか？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t27d1b3cb4711dd79",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Slippage in forex is the difference between the price expected when a forex order is submitted and the price at which it actually executes. It can be positive when the fill is more favorable, negative when the fill is less favorable, or zero when execution occurs at the expected price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">外国為替におけるスリッページとは、外国為替注文が送信されたときに予想される価格と実際に約定する価格との差です。約定が有利な場合は正、約定が不利な場合は負、予想価格で約定が行われる場合はゼロになります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t038d16970cdc4a0d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Positive slippage occurs when an order executes at a price more favorable than expected. For a buy order, this means filling at a price below the expected price. For a sell order, it means filling above it. Positive slippage is still a form of slippage because the actual fill differs from the expected price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">プラスのスリッページは、注文が予想よりも有利な価格で約定したときに発生します。買い注文の場合、これは予想価格を下回る価格で約定することを意味します。売り注文の場合は、その上で約定することを意味します。実際の約定が予想価格と異なるため、プラスのスリッページは依然としてスリッページの一種です。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t50e2ba2afdebd354",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Can slippage be completely avoided?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">スリッページを完全に避けられますか？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te3093e6f641e23b5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">No. Spread is the difference between the current bid and ask prices, while slippage is the difference between an expected or requested execution price and the actual fill price. A trade can experience both spread and slippage because they describe different aspects of pricing and execution.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">いいえ、スプレッドは現在の買値と売値の差であり、スリッページは予想または要求された約定価格と実際の約定価格の差です。スプレッドとスリッページは価格設定と約定のさまざまな側面を表すため、取引ではスプレッドとスリッページの両方が発生する可能性があります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t69cd9215103fb5b1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The basic mechanics of forex slippage are the same for UAE traders as elsewhere: execution depends on the available price when an order is filled. The specific platform settings, instruments, account terms, execution arrangements, and legal entity serving the client can differ, so traders should review the applicable broker documentation.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">外国為替スリッページの基本的な仕組みは、UAE のトレーダーでも他のトレーダーと同じです。約定は、注文が約定されたときの利用可能な価格に依存します。特定のプラットフォーム設定、商品、口座条件、約定取り決め、およびクライアントにサービスを提供する法人は異なる場合があるため、トレーダーは該当するブローカーのドキュメントを確認する必要があります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc57ed3c330dc070d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Understand Execution Before Placing an Order</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">注文を出す前に約定を理解する</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t5720decdcbb7c439",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Slippage is part of trading execution risk. Understanding the relationship between market orders, limit orders, liquidity, volatility, price movement, and execution modes can help traders develop more realistic expectations about the price an order may receive.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">スリッページは取引執行リスクの一部です。成行注文、指値注文、流動性、ボラティリティ、価格変動、および約定モードの関係を理解することは、トレーダーが注文が受け取る可能性のある価格についてより現実的な予想を立てるのに役立ちます。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t111418099ab61d79",
