      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">成行注文とは何ですか?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tad91d1a90e2a6b5d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A market order can fit a plan when:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">成行注文は次の場合に計画に適合します。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta67c4c52499240ba",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The trader is not waiting for a pullback or breakout trigger.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">トレーダーはプルバックやブレイクアウトのトリガーを待っているわけではありません。</span>"
    },
    {
