      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is a Buy Limit Order?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">買い指値注文とは何ですか?</span>"
    },
    {
