    },
    {
      "key": "tde3859cd393a01a5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The trader does not want to buy at 1.1050. Instead, the instruction waits for the market to fall toward 1.1000.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">トレーダーは1.1050で買いたくありません。代わりに、この指示は市場が 1.1000 に向かって下落するのを待ちます。</span>"
    },
    {
