    },
    {
      "key": "t1b56d91d897272a5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is a Stop Order?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">逆指値注文とは何ですか?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t56f772e4fe1500d6",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A stop order remains inactive until the market reaches a predefined trigger, after which the corresponding market operation is activated.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">逆指値注文は、市場が事前定義されたトリガーに達するまで非アクティブなままであり、その後、対応する市場操作がアクティブになります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t01339f9ddf5610eb",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is a Buy Stop Order?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
