        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">買い逆指値注文とは何ですか?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9e58c9d89d63422c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A Buy Stop is normally placed above the current market.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">買いストップは通常、現在の市場の上に設定されます。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t708161defa006676",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Trigger level: 1.1100</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">トリガーレベル: 1.1100</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8638e5a93eab8e55",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Order: Buy Stop at 1.1100</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">注文: 1.1100でストップ買い</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "teea4040c9c04ef94",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The trader is not trying to buy a dip. The instruction waits for an upward price trigger.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">トレーダーは押し目買いをしようとしているわけではない。この命令は価格上昇トリガーを待ちます。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta373f83f90304fb3",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is a Sell Stop Order?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">売り逆指値注文とは何ですか?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te2e59af753e66e57",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Trigger level: 1.1000</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">トリガーレベル: 1.1000</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb4b9f297ff5609eb",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A triggered Sell Stop also becomes a market operation rather than guaranteeing execution exactly at the trigger level.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">トリガーされた売りストップも、トリガー レベルでの実行を正確に保証するのではなく、市場操作になります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9c37db5cd1650156",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Stop Order vs Stop-Loss Order</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">新規の逆指値注文と損切り用の決済逆指値注文</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "taa530400a8711b28",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A stop entry and a Stop Loss may both involve price triggers, but they have different jobs.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">ストップエントリーとストップロスはどちらも価格トリガーを伴う可能性がありますが、役割は異なります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te88fc7bf5febb2ed",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">For a deeper explanation, see</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">Stop-Loss &amp; Take-Profit: A Complete Risk Management Guide</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">さらに詳しい説明については、</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">ストップロスとテイクプロフィット: 完全なリスク管理ガイド</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">を参照してください。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf9a7bee306ef537d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is a Stop-Limit Order?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">ストップリミット注文とは何ですか?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t90594418b5d5ff98",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">With a Buy Stop Limit, for example:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">たとえば、買いストップリミットを使用すると、次のようになります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6374c89da4e07fb7",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The benefit is additional price control after the trigger. The trade-off is execution uncertainty: the limit order created after the trigger may never fill.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">利点は、トリガー後の追加の価格制御です。トレードオフは実行の不確実性です。トリガー後に作成された指値注文は決して約定しない可能性があります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta1ab9e5f8b7d8bfd",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Market Order vs Limit Order vs Stop Order Comparison Table</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">成行注文、指値注文、逆指値注文の比較表</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc35727c4565c91b0",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Market, limit and stop orders differ mainly in when they become executable and how much control the trader has over entry timing and price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/market-order-vs-limit-order-vs-stop-order"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">成行注文、指値注文、ストップ注文は主に、いつ実行可能になるか、トレーダーがエントリーのタイミングと価格をどの程度制御できるかが異なります。</span>"
    },
